
### 1. Health check - expected: 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health

### 2. About endpoint - expected: 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8080/api/about

### 3. Get all tickets - expected: 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets

### 4. Get an existing ticket - expected: 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/T001

### 5. Get a missing ticket - expected: 404 Not Found
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/T999

### 6. Create a valid ticket - expected: 201 Created
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Printer not responding",
  "description": "The office printer is showing as offline.",
  "category": "Hardware",
  "priority": "MEDIUM",
  "createdBy": "amir@example.com"
}

### 7. Create an invalid ticket - expected: 400 Bad Request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "description": "",
  "category": "",
  "priority": "",
  "createdBy": ""
}
